						4700202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4700202,
					"content": "「獵鹿人」的漁人吐司真是太棒了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4700203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4700203,
					"content": "不過，其實這在蒙德城也算是一道配方公開的經典傳統菜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4700204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4700204,
					"content": "#有足夠食材的話，以後{F#妳}{M#你}也可以試著自己做做看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4700205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4700205,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}的手藝，能不能超過「獵鹿人」的出品水準呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4700206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
